' L3 part E: DCF-77 decoder state machine (dcf77_sync.c) and its edge interrupt.
' Every state and transition is preceded by a comment naming its source (file:function).
' Render: README.md, section Render.
@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Serif
skinparam noteFontName DejaVu Serif
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam StateBorderColor black

title L3-E: dekoder DCF-77 (dcf77_sync_step, on_pulse)

' dcf77_sync.c:state_t ST_OFF
state "OFF" as Off : DCF_PON = 1, GPIOTE wył.
' dcf77_sync.c:state_t ST_WAIT_MARKER
state "WAIT_MARKER" as Marker : czeka na impuls\npo przerwie minutowej
' dcf77_sync.c:state_t ST_RECEIVE
state "RECEIVE" as Recv : zbiera 59 bitów
' dcf77_sync.c:finish_frame, dcf77_sync.c:check_frame
state "finish_frame" as Check <<choice>>
' dcf77_sync.c:state_t ST_WAIT_START
state "WAIT_START" as Start : druga ramka przyjęta,\nczeka na początek minuty

[*] --> Off
' dcf77_sync.c:dcf77_sync_open
Off --> Marker : dcf77_sync_open():\nGPIOTE na DCF_OUT, DCF_PON = 0
' dcf77_sync.c:on_pulse, dcf77_sync.c:begin_frame
Marker --> Recv : impuls po przerwie 1,7–2,3 s\n(bit 0 ramki)
' dcf77_sync.c:on_pulse
Recv --> Recv : bit 0 (40–140 ms) lub 1 (150–260 ms),\nokres 0,8–1,2 s
' dcf77_sync.c:on_pulse, dcf77_sync.c:dcf77_sync_step, dcf77_sync.c:drop_frames
Recv --> Marker : zły impuls, okres\nlub zgubiony impuls:\nREJECTED (pulse)
' dcf77_sync.c:on_pulse
Recv --> Check : 59. bit
' dcf77_sync.c:finish_frame, dcf77_sync.c:check_frame, dcf77_sync.c:same_minute
Check --> Marker : pierwsza poprawna ramka → kandydat;\nbłąd znaczników, parzystości, BCD,\ndnia tygodnia → REJECTED;\ndruga ≠ kandydat + 1 min → REJECTED (mismatch)
' dcf77_sync.c:finish_frame
Check --> Start : druga = kandydat + 1 min
' dcf77_sync.c:on_pulse, dcf77_sync.c:close_window
Start --> Off : impuls po przerwie minutowej:\nOK, edge_ms; close_window()
' dcf77_sync.c:on_pulse, dcf77_sync.c:drop_frames
Start --> Marker : inny impuls: REJECTED (pulse)
' dcf77_sync.c:dcf77_sync_step, dcf77_sync.c:close_window
Marker --> Off : 5 min od otwarcia:\nREJECTED (timeout)

' dcf77_sync.c:on_edge
note as Isr
  ISR on_edge (GPIOTE PORT, każde zbocze DCF_OUT):
  narastające: zapisz czas i okres
  od poprzedniego narastającego;
  opadające: szerokość = teraz − narastające;
  poprzedni impuls nieodebrany → overrun,
  inaczej s_pending = true dla dcf77_sync_step.
end note

' dcf77_sync.c:dcf77_sync_step
note bottom of Off
  Limit 5 min działa w każdym stanie
  okna (RECEIVE, WAIT_START też):
  REJECTED (timeout), close_window().
end note
@enduml
